    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5i87fde",
      "content": "Economic planning has played a vital role in shaping India's economy. With Five-Year Plans and NITI Aayog, India has progressed towards self-reliance, growth and modernization."
    },
    {
      "id": "lcqm6b5",
      "type": "numberedList",
      "items": [
        "<strong>IMPORTANT POINTS ON ECONOMIC PLANNING</strong>",
        "Economic planning helps in optimum utilization of scarce resources."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bxk49yi",
      "content": "It ensures that limited resources are used in the most productive manner."
    },
    {
      "id": "1jh9njk",
      "type": "numberedList",
      "items": [
        "Planning helps in correcting market failures."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "qlfmvwt",
      "content": "Government intervention is necessary where private sector fails to invest."
    },
    {
